01:30:32.370 --> 01:30:35.370
He is our creator, he made us.

739
01:30:35.370 --> 01:30:38.370
And we really need to be with him.

740
01:30:38.370 --> 01:30:49.370
And if he made us, then if something is wrong with us, he can also heal us, he can also restore us.

741
01:30:49.370 --> 01:30:52.370
That is not only physical, but also spiritual.

742
01:30:52.370 --> 01:30:57.370
That is all faith, all trust, all loyalty.

743
01:30:57.370 --> 01:31:02.370
Then I must also show what, if it is not there.

744
01:31:02.370 --> 01:31:04.370
If there is no faith.

745
01:31:05.370 --> 01:31:07.370
And then I come to a text.

746
01:31:07.370 --> 01:31:10.370
That is John 16, verses 8 to 11.

747
01:31:10.370 --> 01:31:12.370
I don't know if I mentioned that.

748
01:31:14.370 --> 01:31:16.370
Yes, yes.

749
01:31:16.370 --> 01:31:18.370
Only I also have that in the NBG.

750
01:31:18.370 --> 01:31:21.370
This was also recently mentioned by Pastor Tim.

751
01:31:21.370 --> 01:31:25.370
When Pastor Tim and I used to pray together more often.

752
01:31:25.370 --> 01:31:27.370
And also together with other brothers and sisters.

753
01:31:27.370 --> 01:31:31.370
That text always stood out to me.

754
01:31:31.370 --> 01:31:35.370
Because, yes, this world simply needs to get to know Jesus.

755
01:31:35.370 --> 01:31:38.370
And when I look at this text, it says that as well.

756
01:31:38.370 --> 01:31:44.370
It's just that the first part of the text is the statement that Jesus makes.

757
01:31:44.370 --> 01:31:46.370
That he tells to his friends.

758
01:31:46.370 --> 01:31:49.370
And the second sentence is actually the explanation of that statement.

759
01:31:49.370 --> 01:31:54.370
And that is not often said in one sentence.

760
01:31:54.370 --> 01:31:58.370
And it is important to read that as a whole.

761
01:31:58.370 --> 01:32:00.370
For then you immediately grasp the meaning.

762
01:32:00.370 --> 01:32:03.370
So I want to read it now in the NBG.

763
01:32:03.370 --> 01:32:07.370
And when he comes, that is the Holy Spirit, Jesus speaks about the Holy Spirit.

764
01:32:07.370 --> 01:32:15.370
So when the Holy Spirit comes, he will convict the world of sin, of righteousness, and of judgment.

765
01:32:15.370 --> 01:32:19.370
Of sin, because they do not believe in me.

766
01:32:19.370 --> 01:32:21.370
That is, of course, what we are going to talk about this morning.

767
01:32:21.370 --> 01:32:23.370
I still want to finish that thought.

768
01:32:23.370 --> 01:32:28.370
Of righteousness, because I am going to the Father and you will no longer see me.

769
01:32:28.370 --> 01:32:34.370
Knowing that you may receive that righteousness through faith, we must be focused in faith.

770
01:32:34.370 --> 01:32:35.370
He says that too.

771
01:32:35.370 --> 01:32:38.370
And of judgment is not because we have been judged.

772
01:32:38.370 --> 01:32:42.370
No, it states that the ruler of this world has been judged.

773
01:32:42.370 --> 01:32:43.370
And he has been judged.

774
01:32:43.370 --> 01:32:48.370
So the sin in us and the ruler of this world in us has been judged.

775
01:32:48.370 --> 01:32:54.370
Unless we hold on to it, but we do not because we hold on to Jesus.

776
01:32:54.370 --> 01:33:00.370
So it is so beautiful to see that conviction of sin, that is important.

777
01:33:00.370 --> 01:33:02.370
And that is the work of the Holy Spirit.

778
01:33:02.370 --> 01:33:06.370
And what is going on with that sin?

779
01:33:06.370 --> 01:33:08.370
That comes because there is no faith.

780
01:33:08.370 --> 01:33:17.370
There is no faithfulness, there is no trust, there is no certainty, there is no clarity of who God is.

781
01:33:17.370 --> 01:33:25.370
So you are actually living in a gap and then anything can happen.

782
01:33:25.370 --> 01:33:28.370
And the most logical thing that happens is sin.

783
01:33:28.370 --> 01:33:31.370
For that sin is the consequence of it.

784
01:33:31.370 --> 01:33:35.370
If we do not believe in Him, that is that sin.

785
01:33:35.370 --> 01:33:40.370
It is about, if we believe in Him, then it is precisely that we make God happy.

786
01:33:40.370 --> 01:33:43.370
Then that is our purpose to make Him happy.

787
01:33:43.370 --> 01:33:46.370
If there is no faith, then that is sin.

788
01:33:46.370 --> 01:33:49.370
Then we miss our goal, then we miss our purpose.

789
01:33:49.370 --> 01:33:54.370
And we really need to let this sink in.

790
01:33:54.370 --> 01:33:56.370
And that is the work of the Holy Spirit.

791
01:33:56.370 --> 01:33:59.370
That we are aware of the fact that faith is needed.

792
01:33:59.370 --> 01:34:04.370
Paul himself says, everything that does not come from faith is sin.

793
01:34:04.370 --> 01:34:07.370
He adds even more to it.

794
01:34:07.370 --> 01:34:10.370
And I actually like Paul, because he makes it extra clear.

795
01:34:10.370 --> 01:34:14.370
That everything we do not do from faith is sin.

796
01:34:14.370 --> 01:34:22.370
He shows that it is so important that everything we do, that you may think about it.

797
01:34:22.370 --> 01:34:25.370
And that you may do it from the faithfulness of Christ.

798
01:34:25.370 --> 01:34:32.370
And of course we do not want to miss our goal.

799
01:34:32.370 --> 01:34:34.370
We want to make God happy.

800
01:34:34.370 --> 01:34:42.370
And what is the opposite of faith, is for example fear or uncertainty or despair or powerlessness.

801
01:34:42.370 --> 01:34:48.370
Faith is often tested when fear or uncertainty, through difficulties or whatever, comes upon us.

802
01:34:48.370 --> 01:34:51.370
Then our faith is precisely tested.

803
01:34:51.370 --> 01:34:53.370
And in this world, it only gets worse.

804
01:34:53.370 --> 01:34:54.370
And what do you do then?

805
01:34:54.370 --> 01:34:56.370
Do you seek it somewhere else?

806
01:34:56.370 --> 01:34:58.370
And that is the point.

807
01:34:58.370 --> 01:35:06.370
Do you then look for something to hold on to, to lift you up, or seek your hope or your misery elsewhere?

808
01:35:06.370 --> 01:35:07.370
But then you end up with idolatry again.

809
01:35:07.370 --> 01:35:09.370
And that often brings even more misery.

810
01:35:10.370 --> 01:35:12.370
And then you turn away from God.

811
01:35:12.370 --> 01:35:16.370
And the prophets are full of God saying, then you haven't thought of me.

812
01:35:16.370 --> 01:35:19.370
For everyone went their own way.

813
01:35:19.370 --> 01:35:25.370
It seems as if you never cared about what I think of it.

814
01:35:25.370 --> 01:35:29.370
That was His reproach in the prophets to the people of Israel.

815
01:35:29.370 --> 01:35:32.370
And I think we should reflect on that.

816
01:35:32.370 --> 01:35:38.370
That if God says something like that to people, then I want to let such a text come in.

817
01:35:38.370 --> 01:35:40.370
And I find that important.

818
01:35:40.370 --> 01:35:46.370
For if you disregard God and just go your own way, that only leads to disasters.

819
01:35:46.370 --> 01:35:53.370
And you are not made and engaged as He has always intended you to be.

820
01:35:53.370 --> 01:35:55.370
And that only brings misery.

821
01:35:55.370 --> 01:35:58.370
And what is on the other side?

822
01:35:58.370 --> 01:36:00.370
On the other side is true faith and trust.

823
01:36:00.370 --> 01:36:03.370
Also perfect love, for it knows no fear.

824
01:36:03.370 --> 01:36:06.370
So there you have love, hope, and faith together again.

825
01:36:07.370 --> 01:36:09.370
And everything comes together.

826
01:36:09.370 --> 01:36:14.370
So let us please trust in him, worship him, and not commit idolatry.

827
01:36:14.370 --> 01:36:19.370
That is when faith is not in our lives.

828
01:36:19.370 --> 01:36:21.370
And then what to do.

829
01:36:21.370 --> 01:36:23.370
What are we going to do with that faith?

830
01:36:23.370 --> 01:36:24.370
Also an important one.

831
01:36:24.370 --> 01:36:26.370
I have a different picture of that.

832
01:36:26.370 --> 01:36:29.370
That is not Frieks, but it is beautiful.

833
01:36:29.370 --> 01:36:33.370
This picture is in my basement.

834
01:36:33.370 --> 01:36:41.370
That is my space where I have my quality moments.

835
01:36:41.370 --> 01:36:44.370
I find this one so beautiful.

836
01:36:44.370 --> 01:36:47.370
Lovine also painted this.

837
01:36:47.370 --> 01:36:49.370
A sister of ours.

838
01:36:49.370 --> 01:36:57.370
This is about the story and the history of Peter.

839
01:36:57.370 --> 01:37:00.370
Who wanted to walk to Jesus on the water.

840
01:37:00.370 --> 01:37:03.370
For Jesus had gone to pray himself.

841
01:37:03.370 --> 01:37:07.370
And he was away from his friends for a moment.

842
01:37:07.370 --> 01:37:10.370
Because he wanted to have a short time with the Father.

843
01:37:10.370 --> 01:37:11.370
Just like I do in my basement.

844
01:37:11.370 --> 01:37:15.370
And he thought something like, oh yes, they have gone sailing.

845
01:37:15.370 --> 01:37:17.370
Yes, yes, yes, what am I doing now?

846
01:37:17.370 --> 01:37:19.370
Well, he might not have even thought about it.

847
01:37:19.370 --> 01:37:21.370
I think he just walked on the water.

848
01:37:21.370 --> 01:37:22.370
And he walked towards that boat.

849
01:37:22.370 --> 01:37:25.370
So those disciples who were in that boat, those friends of Jesus.

850
01:37:25.370 --> 01:37:27.370
They thought, wow, a ghost.

851
01:37:27.370 --> 01:37:29.370
What is this?

852
01:37:29.370 --> 01:37:35.370
And then Peter, being who he is, called out to Jesus.

853
01:37:35.370 --> 01:37:41.370
Saying, well, yes, if you are really Jesus.

854
01:37:41.370 --> 01:37:43.370
Because they were still doubting.

855
01:37:43.370 --> 01:37:46.370
Then call me, and I will come to you.

856
01:37:46.370 --> 01:37:48.370
Well, that is really a beautiful Peter action.

857
01:37:48.370 --> 01:37:49.370
I really think this is amazing.

858
01:37:49.370 --> 01:37:53.370
And then you see Peter walking on the water.

859
01:37:53.370 --> 01:37:56.370
And he steps towards Jesus.

860
01:37:57.370 --> 01:38:00.370
And then the waves start to rise a bit again.

861
01:38:00.370 --> 01:38:01.370
So I see it for a moment.

862
01:38:01.370 --> 01:38:03.370
And then Peter looks at those waves.

863
01:38:03.370 --> 01:38:05.370
And then you think, oh, I actually started this.

864
01:38:05.370 --> 01:38:08.370
And then he sinks.

865
01:38:08.370 --> 01:38:09.370
Then he sinks into that water.

866
01:38:09.370 --> 01:38:12.370
And then this is, so to speak, the hand.

867
01:38:12.370 --> 01:38:17.370
Here Peter has really sunk quite a bit.

868
01:38:17.370 --> 01:38:20.370
But that can sometimes be the case.

869
01:38:20.370 --> 01:38:24.370
When you are sometimes so affected in your life.

870
01:38:24.370 --> 01:38:26.370
Or that you are affected traumatically.

871
01:38:26.370 --> 01:38:28.370
Or whatever has come your way.

872
01:38:28.370 --> 01:38:32.370
Then you can really go under in life.

873
01:38:32.370 --> 01:38:37.370
And yes, this is the painting that tells this story.

874
01:38:37.370 --> 01:38:38.370
And this history.

875
01:38:38.370 --> 01:38:40.370
And this certainty.

876
01:38:40.370 --> 01:38:43.370
Yes, depict it.

877
01:38:43.370 --> 01:38:45.370
And I think it's wonderful.

878
01:38:45.370 --> 01:38:48.370
When I look at the picture, this is what Jesus does.

879
01:38:48.370 --> 01:38:50.370
And what does he do?

880
01:38:50.370 --> 01:38:52.370
Peter did not keep his eyes on him.

881
01:38:52.370 --> 01:38:55.370
But Jesus is the one who picks us up.

882
01:38:55.370 --> 01:38:57.370
And he sets us back on that water.

883
01:38:57.370 --> 01:38:59.370
And this is what he wants to do.

884
01:38:59.370 --> 01:39:02.370
This is what Jesus does with his Christ.

885
01:39:02.370 --> 01:39:06.370
Christ.

886
01:39:06.370 --> 01:39:08.370
Yes, Greek is not my strongest point yet.

887
01:39:08.370 --> 01:39:09.370
But it is true.

888
01:39:09.370 --> 01:39:11.370
He wants to set you back on the water.

889
01:39:11.370 --> 01:39:14.370
He wants you to believe again.

890
01:39:14.370 --> 01:39:16.370
This is his mission.

891
01:39:16.370 --> 01:39:18.370
With everything he has done.

892
01:39:18.370 --> 01:39:21.370
He wants to make this faith alive in us.

893
01:39:21.370 --> 01:39:23.370
In every circumstance.

894
01:39:23.370 --> 01:39:24.370
In every disappointment.

895
01:39:24.370 --> 01:39:25.370
Every sorrow.

896
01:39:25.370 --> 01:39:26.370
Traumas.

897
01:39:26.370 --> 01:39:27.370
Difficult times.

898
01:39:27.370 --> 01:39:28.370
Heavy tasks.

899
01:39:28.370 --> 01:39:29.370
War. Peace.

900
01:39:29.370 --> 01:39:31.370
But also in good times.

901
01:39:31.370 --> 01:39:32.370
Of course.

902
01:39:32.370 --> 01:39:34.370
He wants to carry us.

903
01:39:34.370 --> 01:39:38.370
And he is, as it were, that cornerstone.

904
01:39:38.370 --> 01:39:39.370
That rock.

905
01:39:39.370 --> 01:39:42.370
That goes along with us beneath the water's surface.

906
01:39:42.370 --> 01:39:44.370
For we walk on him.

907
01:39:44.370 --> 01:39:47.370
And I want to give you this picture.

908
01:39:47.370 --> 01:39:50.370
Also as an image of how faith can be.

909
01:39:51.370 --> 01:39:55.370
For he wants us to act and walk in faith.

910
01:39:55.370 --> 01:39:58.370
And in this way, he wants to build his church.

911
01:39:58.370 --> 01:40:02.370
This is the building of the church of Christ.

912
01:40:02.370 --> 01:40:05.370
For we are coming back to our destination.

913
01:40:05.370 --> 01:40:07.370
When things have gone completely wrong.

914
01:40:07.370 --> 01:40:08.370
I have experienced that too.

915
01:40:08.370 --> 01:40:10.370
Then he pulls me out of that water.

916
01:40:10.370 --> 01:40:12.370
And sets me back on the water.

917
01:40:12.370 --> 01:40:16.370
So that I can dance on that water again as his child.

918
01:40:16.370 --> 01:40:19.370
And however small your faith may be.

919
01:40:19.370 --> 01:40:20.370
That is not a problem.

920
01:40:20.370 --> 01:40:22.370
I want to reassure us.

921
01:40:22.370 --> 01:40:25.370
For our faith is by definition small.

922
01:40:25.370 --> 01:40:27.370
Why? Because he is so great.

923
01:40:27.370 --> 01:40:29.370
But together with him.

924
01:40:29.370 --> 01:40:31.370
That complete picture of those slopes.

925
01:40:31.370 --> 01:40:34.370
Is what he wants to do.

926
01:40:34.370 --> 01:40:36.370
And he wants us to grow in that.

927
01:40:36.370 --> 01:40:38.370
He wants us to become more and more like him.

928
01:40:38.370 --> 01:40:40.370
So that we may also encourage each other.

929
01:40:40.370 --> 01:40:43.370
And that we may show each other how good he is.

930
01:40:43.370 --> 01:40:46.370
And if it goes wrong once in a while.

931
01:40:46.370 --> 01:40:49.370
Then hold on to him tightly.

932
01:40:49.370 --> 01:40:52.370
Just as Paul says, I have been seized by him.

933
01:40:52.370 --> 01:40:54.370
That is the only thing we can do.

934
01:40:54.370 --> 01:40:56.370
And we must do that as well.

935
01:40:56.370 --> 01:40:59.370
And then I want to mention a few short things.

936
01:40:59.370 --> 01:41:01.370
That are also important.

937
01:41:01.370 --> 01:41:03.370
With acting and walking in faith.

938
01:41:03.370 --> 01:41:05.370
That is praying.

939
01:41:05.370 --> 01:41:08.370
If I have a text from Philippians 4:6-7.

940
01:41:08.370 --> 01:41:11.370
I did not have that projected.

941
01:41:11.370 --> 01:41:12.370
But there it says.

942
01:41:12.370 --> 01:41:14.370
Do not be worried or afraid about things.

943
01:41:14.370 --> 01:41:16.370
But pray instead.

944
01:41:16.370 --> 01:41:18.370
Pray for and about everything.

945
01:41:18.370 --> 01:41:20.370
And I often pray myself.

946
01:41:20.370 --> 01:41:23.370
I take the Bible for a specific circumstance.

947
01:41:23.370 --> 01:41:25.370
And then I pray from it about that situation.

948
01:41:25.370 --> 01:41:26.370
In faith.

949
01:41:26.370 --> 01:41:27.370
In trust.

950
01:41:27.370 --> 01:41:30.370
In knowing that His faithfulness will meet me.

951
01:41:30.370 --> 01:41:34.370
And it also says underneath.

952
01:41:34.370 --> 01:41:37.370
That our Father desires it.

953
01:41:37.370 --> 01:41:39.370
That we are dependent on Him.

954
01:41:39.370 --> 01:41:43.370
That He longs to hear our wishes.

955
01:41:43.370 --> 01:41:45.370
He wants to hear your wishes.

956
01:41:45.370 --> 01:41:47.370
So talk to Him about all your needs.

957
01:41:47.370 --> 01:41:48.370
All your wishes.

958
01:41:48.370 --> 01:41:50.370
And be thankful for what He has already done for you.

959
01:41:50.370 --> 01:41:52.370
And then know that the peace of God.

960
01:41:52.370 --> 01:41:56.370
And that is a peace that simply goes far beyond our human understanding.

961
01:41:56.370 --> 01:41:59.370
Watch over your heart and soul.

962
01:41:59.370 --> 01:42:01.370
In Jesus, His anointed one.

963
01:42:01.370 --> 01:42:03.370
Or rather the Messiah.

964
01:42:03.370 --> 01:42:05.370
Another point.

965
01:42:05.370 --> 01:42:07.370
That is in Jude 20.

966
01:42:07.370 --> 01:42:09.370
That is a brother of Jesus.

967
01:42:09.370 --> 01:42:11.370
He has only written one chapter.

968
01:42:11.370 --> 01:42:13.370
So actually it is Jude verse 20.

969
01:42:13.370 --> 01:42:15.370
There he also says.

970
01:42:15.370 --> 01:42:19.370
Build your life on the foundation of your most holy faith.

971
01:42:19.370 --> 01:42:20.370
For faith is holy.

972
01:42:20.370 --> 01:42:21.370
It is pure.

973
01:42:21.370 --> 01:42:23.370
You cannot buy faith at the supermarket.

974
01:42:23.370 --> 01:42:25.370
They might be able to put it in a can.

975
01:42:25.370 --> 01:42:27.370
But that is just not real.

976
01:42:27.370 --> 01:42:29.370
That is simply not for sale.

977
01:42:29.370 --> 01:42:30.370
The same goes for love.

978
01:42:30.370 --> 01:42:31.370
Hope is not for sale either.

979
01:42:31.370 --> 01:42:32.370
You need to go to Jesus for that.

980
01:42:32.370 --> 01:42:34.370
And He gives it.

981
01:42:34.370 --> 01:42:35.370
And he says.

982
01:42:35.370 --> 01:42:39.370
Build your life on the foundation of your most holy faith.

983
01:42:40.370 --> 01:42:42.370
By praying in the Holy Spirit.

984
01:42:42.370 --> 01:42:44.370
Let the Holy Spirit guide you in your prayer.

985
01:42:44.370 --> 01:42:46.370
For then you will come.

986
01:42:46.370 --> 01:42:48.370
Then you will be planted above that situation.

987
01:42:48.370 --> 01:42:51.370
When the circumstances come at you like mountains.

988
01:42:51.370 --> 01:42:55.370
Then you may let the Holy Spirit lift you up.

989
01:42:55.370 --> 01:42:58.370
And then such a mountain becomes a stepping stone.

990
01:42:58.370 --> 01:43:00.370
To the new level of your faith.

991
01:43:00.370 --> 01:43:02.370
And of your faithfulness.

992
01:43:02.370 --> 01:43:04.370
One more practical point.

993
01:43:04.370 --> 01:43:06.370
Get enough sleep.

994
01:43:06.370 --> 01:43:08.370
I did not do that last night.

